                <pb facs="0668" n="588" sameAs="frus:frus1902/pg588"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Powell to Mr.
                            Hay.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.—Paraphrase.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Legation of the United States</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Port au Prince</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1902-05-15"><hi rendition="#italic">May 15,
                        1902</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>(Mr. Powell states that the presence at Port au Prince of a United States naval
                    vessel is urgently needed, and requests to be informed when one may be
                    expected.)</p>
            </div>
        </body>
